% fortad bibliography.
%
% Metadata only. No PDF, no full text, and no publisher-formatted excerpt is
% ever committed to this repository. `scripts/fetch_literature.py` resolves each
% entry against Crossref/arXiv/DBLP and downloads only openly licensed copies
% into the gitignored `literature/` tree; paywalled items are reported with
% their identifier so they can be retrieved through the reader's own access.
%
% DOIs are deliberately absent from most entries: the fetch script resolves and
% records them from Crossref, so the committed file never asserts an identifier
% that has not been machine-verified. Run the script before citing.

% ---------------------------------------------------------------- foundations

@book{griewank2008evaluating,
